The MIT license above covers the model files, meshes and scripts in this folder.
It does NOT grant any rights to the ABU Robocon 2027 game design, its rules, or the
official field drawings: those belong to ABU Robocon and the organising committee.
This package is an unofficial, fan-made simulation asset derived from the published
rulebook and an official assembly CAD export, and must not be used as a construction
drawing for a real field.

